# BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore file: used INSTEAD of .dockerignore when
# building `docker build -f Dockerfile.agent` (docker/build-push-action v6
# honors it too). The root .dockerignore excludes agent/ to keep the
# control-plane context Go-only; this file does the inverse — keep only
# the Rust agent workspace (issue #76).
*
!agent/
# Never ship build artifacts or local state into the builder cache.
agent/target
